  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "せびれで　ねつを　きゅうしゅうしてこおりエネルギーに　へんかんする。こうおんほど　エネルギーが　たまる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "등지느러미로 열을 흡수해서 얼음 에너지로 변환한다. 고온일수록 에너지가 많이 모인다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "會用背鰭吸收熱能以轉換成冰之能量。溫度越高，累積的能量就越多。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Sa crête dorsale absorbe la chaleur et la convertit en énergie de type Glace. Plus la chaleur est intense, plus il emmagasine de l’énergie.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Mit seiner Rückenflosse absorbiert es Wärme und wandelt diese in Eis-Energie um. Je wärmer es ist, desto mehr Energie kann es speichern.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Absorbe el calor a través de la placa dorsal y lo convierte en energía gélida. Cuanto más alta es la temperatura, más energía acumula.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Assorbe il calore con la pinna dorsale e lo trasforma in energia Ghiaccio. Più alta è la temperatura, più energia accumula.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Frigibax absorbs heat through its dorsal fin and converts the heat into ice energy. The higher the temperature, the more energy Frigibax stores.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "背びれで　熱を　吸収して氷エネルギーに　変換する。高温ほど　エネルギーが　溜まる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "会用背鳍来吸收热量，并将其转换成冰之能量。温度越高，积累的能量就越多。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Absorbe el calor a través de la placa dorsal y lo convierte en energía gélida. Cuanto más alta es la temperatura, más energía acumula.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "いわばや　しんりんに　せいそくする。せびれの　ちからで　すあなのなかをれいとうこのように　ひやしている。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "암석 지대나 삼림에 서식한다. 등지느러미의 힘으로 굴 안을 냉장고처럼 차갑게 만든다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "棲息在岩石地帶或森林裡。會用背鰭的力量將巢穴裡的溫度降到如冷凍庫般寒冷。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il vit dans les zones rocheuses et les forêts. Sa crête dorsale lui permet de refroidir l’intérieur de son nid à la manière d’un congélateur.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es lebt in Wäldern und Felsgebieten. Mit der Kraft seiner Rückenflosse kühlt es sein Nest wie eine Gefriertruhe herunter.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Vive en bosques y entornos pedregosos. Se vale del poder de su placa dorsal para refrigerar su madriguera como si fuera un frigorífico.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Vive nelle foreste e in aree rocciose. Usa la cresta dorsale per raffreddare l’interno della tana quasi come fosse un frigorifero.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "This Pokémon lives in forests and craggy areas. Using the power of its dorsal fin, it cools the inside of its nest like a refrigerator.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "岩場や　森林に　生息する。背びれの　力で　巣穴の中を冷凍庫のように　冷やしている。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
